<p><img src="images/SubHead_Welcome.gif" alt="Welcome!" WIDTH="207" HEIGHT="38"></p>

<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
  <tr>
    <td width="20"><img src="images/spacer.gif" width="35" height="1"></td>
    <td width="578">
	<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
      <tr>
        <td valign="top">
						<table border="0" cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			  <tr>
			    <td bgColor="#000000" width="100%" colspan="2"><table border="0" cellPadding="2"
			    cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			      <tr>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><small><font face="Arial">June 06, 2001 <strong>LH>Faydedar ... DUH!</strong></font></small></td>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><font face="Arial"><strong><p
			        align="right"><a href="news.php3?command=EDIT&id=48"><img src="images/edit_button.gif" alt="Edit this stroy" WIDTH="21" HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a><a href="delete_news.php3?id=48&a=66"><img src="images/delete_button.gif" alt="Delete this story" WIDTH="21"
			        HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a></strong></font></td>
			      </tr>
			    </table>
			    </td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial">This evening LH paid a visit to the beautiful hidden oasis in Timorous Deep.<br>
Faydedar was no match for the 3 groups of LH and a few of our friends from RoH.<br>
The only Death of the evening was Faydedar's.  Grats to Ambien on his loot =)</font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td><td><p align="right"><font face="Arial"><small>--<a href="profile.php3?id=66">Zurin</a> <small>2:51am est</small></small><br>
			    </font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial"><img src="images/spacer.gif" width="440"
			    height="16"></font></td>
			  </tr>
			</table>
					<table border="0" cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			  <tr>
			    <td bgColor="#000000" width="100%" colspan="2"><table border="0" cellPadding="2"
			    cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			      <tr>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><small><font face="Arial">June 02, 2001 <strong>Royal Success!</strong></font></small></td>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><font face="Arial"><strong><p
			        align="right"><a href="news.php3?command=EDIT&id=47"><img src="images/edit_button.gif" alt="Edit this stroy" WIDTH="21" HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a><a href="delete_news.php3?id=47&a=3"><img src="images/delete_button.gif" alt="Delete this story" WIDTH="21"
			        HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a></strong></font></td>
			      </tr>
			    </table>
			    </td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial">Today LH &amp; Friends stormed Chardok -  Congrats to Galatera and Shanarian on epic pieces, and Congratulations Jedi Lifecrusher on obtaining his glow sticks!  Rar!</font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td><td><p align="right"><font face="Arial"><small>--<a href="profile.php3?id=3">Fenya</a> <small>5:18pm est</small></small><br>
			    </font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial"><img src="images/spacer.gif" width="440"
			    height="16"></font></td>
			  </tr>
			</table>
					<table border="0" cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			  <tr>
			    <td bgColor="#000000" width="100%" colspan="2"><table border="0" cellPadding="2"
			    cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			      <tr>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><small><font face="Arial">May 31, 2001 <strong>Trakanon Dead ... again</strong></font></small></td>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><font face="Arial"><strong><p
			        align="right"><a href="news.php3?command=EDIT&id=46"><img src="images/edit_button.gif" alt="Edit this stroy" WIDTH="21" HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a><a href="delete_news.php3?id=46&a=66"><img src="images/delete_button.gif" alt="Delete this story" WIDTH="21"
			        HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a></strong></font></td>
			      </tr>
			    </table>
			    </td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial">36 of us with only 1 mage as a nuker managed to take out Trak in about 30 seconds.  Grats Mordone on Manna Robe and Elling on Cloak of Piety.  Teeth went to Demari, Skuerto, Antar and Bindel.  Dreadyn found out that Traknon doesn't like cat hats, but perhaps the most impressive thing about tonight was Grimmlok not dying =D</font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td><td><p align="right"><font face="Arial"><small>--<a href="profile.php3?id=66">Zurin</a> <small>3:44am est</small></small><br>
			    </font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial"><img src="images/spacer.gif" width="440"
			    height="16"></font></td>
			  </tr>
			</table>
					<table border="0" cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			  <tr>
			    <td bgColor="#000000" width="100%" colspan="2"><table border="0" cellPadding="2"
			    cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			      <tr>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><small><font face="Arial">May 22, 2001 <strong>if you blinked, you missed it.</strong></font></small></td>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><font face="Arial"><strong><p
			        align="right"><a href="news.php3?command=EDIT&id=45"><img src="images/edit_button.gif" alt="Edit this stroy" WIDTH="21" HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a><a href="delete_news.php3?id=45&a=4"><img src="images/delete_button.gif" alt="Delete this story" WIDTH="21"
			        HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a></strong></font></td>
			      </tr>
			    </table>
			    </td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial">holy cuchomongos, Trak fell at record speed last night. with  only 2 deaths (guess who was the first).  record time = phat lewts.  grats to gwynedd on her SS bp and grats Digriz on his Myrlokar bp.  teeth went to celebdraug, tinkle, farkas, and gruleb =)</font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td><td><p align="right"><font face="Arial"><small>--<a href="profile.php3?id=4">Jarone</a> <small>4:41pm est</small></small><br>
			    </font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial"><img src="images/spacer.gif" width="440"
			    height="16"></font></td>
			  </tr>
			</table>
					<table border="0" cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			  <tr>
			    <td bgColor="#000000" width="100%" colspan="2"><table border="0" cellPadding="2"
			    cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			      <tr>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><small><font face="Arial">May 20, 2001 <strong>10th Coldain Ring Complete!</strong></font></small></td>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><font face="Arial"><strong><p
			        align="right"><a href="news.php3?command=EDIT&id=44"><img src="images/edit_button.gif" alt="Edit this stroy" WIDTH="21" HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a><a href="delete_news.php3?id=44&a=3"><img src="images/delete_button.gif" alt="Delete this story" WIDTH="21"
			        HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a></strong></font></td>
			      </tr>
			    </table>
			    </td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial">In an epic battle between the Coldain and Kromrif, the troops of Last Hope, SoC, Grail Brotherhood, Forlorn, and so many others successfully defeated the giants.  Congratulations Jarone!</font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td><font face="Arial"><small><a href="http://vnboards.ign.com/message.asp?topic=11856223&">Click here to find out more!</a></small><br></font></td>
<td><p align="right"><font face="Arial"><small>--<a href="profile.php3?id=3">Fenya</a> <small>7:04pm est</small></small><br>
			    </font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial"><img src="images/spacer.gif" width="440"
			    height="16"></font></td>
			  </tr>
			</table>
					<table border="0" cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			  <tr>
			    <td bgColor="#000000" width="100%" colspan="2"><table border="0" cellPadding="2"
			    cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			      <tr>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><small><font face="Arial">May 20, 2001 <strong>Thanks for another great Sky raid..</strong></font></small></td>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><font face="Arial"><strong><p
			        align="right"><a href="news.php3?command=EDIT&id=43"><img src="images/edit_button.gif" alt="Edit this stroy" WIDTH="21" HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a><a href="delete_news.php3?id=43&a=18"><img src="images/delete_button.gif" alt="Delete this story" WIDTH="21"
			        HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a></strong></font></td>
			      </tr>
			    </table>
			    </td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial">Many thanks to all who came out today for the Sky raid.  We ended up with blades for all the warriors and a few folks got to finish some Sky quest items.  Thanks for the great fun!!!</font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td><td><p align="right"><font face="Arial"><small>--<a href="profile.php3?id=18">Tinkle</a> <small>2:24am est</small></small><br>
			    </font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial"><img src="images/spacer.gif" width="440"
			    height="16"></font></td>
			  </tr>
			</table>
					<table border="0" cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			  <tr>
			    <td bgColor="#000000" width="100%" colspan="2"><table border="0" cellPadding="2"
			    cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			      <tr>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><small><font face="Arial">May 06, 2001 <strong>Gorenaire Dead!</strong></font></small></td>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><font face="Arial"><strong><p
			        align="right"><a href="news.php3?command=EDIT&id=42"><img src="images/edit_button.gif" alt="Edit this stroy" WIDTH="21" HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a><a href="delete_news.php3?id=42&a=11"><img src="images/delete_button.gif" alt="Delete this story" WIDTH="21"
			        HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a></strong></font></td>
			      </tr>
			    </table>
			    </td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial">Gorenaire falls to LH, SoC, GB, and many friends.  A special congratulations to Demari on her white scale!</font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td><td><p align="right"><font face="Arial"><small>--<a href="profile.php3?id=11">Icemistress</a> <small>4:28pm est</small></small><br>
			    </font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial"><img src="images/spacer.gif" width="440"
			    height="16"></font></td>
